SY_TALK("fRY5OI8VydM",[[274,["We have gathered here on the occassion of Ram Navami"]],[278,["and everybody has said"]],[280,["that, \"Mother please tell us about Shri Rama\"."]],[286,["As you know that Shri Rama has taken"]],[291,["a very important place in our chakras."]],[295,["He is seated on our right heart."]],[302,["Shri Rama"]],[307,["represents the place of the father (right heart),"]],[311,["so lack of father's responsibility"]],[318,["or father's love"]],[321,["can cause a catch of this chakra."]],[328,["In Sahaja Yoga we can understand that Rama"]],[334,["and all other Gods"]],[341,["came on earth as different manifestations of divine energy (shakti);"]],[347,["they came to do their jobs."]],[350,["In that sense Shri Rama has a special job."]],[356,["Like Socrates has said benevolent king has to come."]],[362,["As a reflection of that Shri Rama came."]],[368,["Shri Rama came in complete human form"]],[372,["He even forgot that he is a incarnation of Shri Vishnu."]],[378,["He was made to forget this."]],[381,["However for the world"]],[385,["He was Purushottam (Ideal human being)."]],[391,["You all must have heard of his qualities and his childhood"]],[399,["In Sahaja yoga we should understand"]],[406,["that when we worship any of the Gods,"]],[411,["when we consider them as our ideal,"]],[416,["then which qualities we can gain from them,"]],[422,["which qualities we have received?"]],[425,["Shri Rama has many noble qualities."]],[428,["One quality was that He was Purushotam (ideal),"]],[431,["another was how He ruled as a king."]],[439,["He kept his people's opinions higher than Himself,"]],[444,["higher than his wife and children."]],[449,["In the present time,"]],[457,["if people and politicians understand this point,"]],[462,["they wouldn't be called as selfish,"]],[466,["they wouldn't be selfish,"]],[468,["they would be followers of Dharma."]],[471,["However, none has tried to adopt Shri Rama as a role model till now."]],[480,["On the other hand, they will sing His bhajans"]],[483,["or in his name build large organisations and temples."]],[490,["By doing all this, has Shri Rama come in the hearts of these people?"]],[496,["Can you get His light in your life?"]],[499,["Only Sahaja Yogis can do this"]],[501,["that is to bring the light of Shri Rama into their attention."]],[510,["He is totally without any attachments."]],[513,["As it is, all the deities are free from sins and punyas(good deeds),"]],[518,["Whatever we deem as a sin"]],[522,["if they do, is not a sin."]],[524,["For example, Shri Krishna killed many people,"]],[528,["Shri Rama killed Ravana."]],[531,["It can be considered a sin in worldly sense"]],[537,["but not in the eyes of God."]],[541,["Because they destroy evil people and remove evils"]],[546,["and they have the right to do whatever is needed for this purpose."]],[552,["Like when Shri Devi slayed rakshasas, She killed the demons."]],[558,["Some people may ask if She has committed a sin."]],[560,["However Her responsibility is to destroy the rakshasas"]],[565,["and protect the saints."]],[573,["In Shri Rama's life Ahilya's redemption is the most important event."]],[579,["He reedemed Ahilya."]],[581,["She was cursed by her husband."]],[586,["In those times if any women goes out of dharma,"]],[591,["and if her husband was a saint of high stature,"]],[595,["he could curse her."]],[599,["But Ahillya was blamed falsely."]],[603,["and false allegations were made."]],[606,["And she was made into stone."]],[609,["So Shri Rama saved Ahilya."]],[614,["Particularly His attitude towards His wife,"]],[622,["His love for Her,"]],[625,["His commitment to having only one wife"]],[631,["is something to be really understood."]],[634,["Even though He knew that Sitaji was the incarnation of Shri Mahalaxmi"]],[638,["She Herself was a Devi."]],[640,["But in His human form"]],[643,["He never raised His eyes to look at any other women but his wife."]],[650,["When we talk about Shri Rama"]],[652,["the husband like qualities inside us should be pure."]],[658,["When any lady thinks about Shri Rama"]],[663,["she should have the same faith in her husband"]],[667,["like Shri Sita had in Her husband."]],[670,["Similarly, husbands also need to adopt the quality of Shri Rama"]],[674,["of being devoted to their one wife."]],[677,["This is not difficult for Sahaja Yogis."]],[679,["Women should be respected. Have respect for your wife!"]],[684,["Although Ravana kidnapped Sitaji"]],[688,["Shri Rama felt it is His duty to rescue Her."]],[694,["But in His kingdom it was His duty to follow the will of the people"]],[698,["and He had so much balance"]],[700,["that Shri Sita only for whom He woeked hard to rescue"]],[705,["He left Her because of the will of the people."]],[708,["As Sitaji Herself was the Goddess,"]],[710,["this had no particular impact on Her,"]],[714,["it had no consequence."]],[716,["So Shri Rama sacrificied Her."]],[718,["People talk about such things which are not in public interest."]],[724,["Being their ideal, He did not want them to think that He condoned"]],[729,["keeping the company of women whose character is under doubt."]],[735,["Although She was the unblemishable Devi (Nishkalanka),"]],[738,["She was the embodiment of the purity of the Devi,"]],[741,["when He left Her, in one way She left Him too."]],[746,["She left Him in a manner a woman would do"]],[749,["and Shri Rama as a man would do."]],[752,["Sitaji disappeared into the Mother Earth"]],[755,["and then in the end Shri Rama went into River Sarayu."]],[761,["Their life was very eventful and full of miracles."]],[768,["In their whole life you can see how Shri Sita and Shri Rama"]],[771,["had respect and were faithful to each other."]],[777,["Even though Shri Rama left Shri Sita,"]],[780,["She understood that it was His royal duty,"]],[783,["and She never complained or talked ill of Him."]],[787,["And effortlessly She raised Her children,"]],[792,["and made them flourish and develop."]],[796,["Shri Rama's two children are called Luv and Kush."]],[802,["They came like devotees"]],[806,["and in this world we can see them as the ideal disciples."]],[811,["They represent the disciple principle"]],[813,["and for us they are the power of disciplehood"]],[819,["with which we can become disciple of someone."]],[822,["As disciples they learned archery at a very young age."]],[828,["In their young age they learned Ramayana"]],[832,["and got proficiency in music."]],[836,["It means that the disciples must surrender completely to their guru."]],[843,["We also have the qualities of a disciple innately within us."]],[848,["They were completely surrendered to their Mother, who was Shakti."]],[856,["Even they were about to fight against Shri Rama for their Mother,"]],[861,["so they kept their Mother as the highest in the world."]],[865,["The Mother also cared for them,"]],[868,["nurtured them and made them stand on dharma."]],[871,["To make them progress was Her foremost priority and duty."]],[874,["Not like today's wives who would have cried:"]],[877,["\"My husband left me, my husband has left me\"."]],[879,["But when they get a husband they will fight all the time"]],[883,["and when the husband leaves them then they will cry."]],[886,["Unlike Sitaji who felt: \"If He has left Me, no problem."]],[888,["These are My children, I will take care of them."]],[891,["And nothing should happen that deprive them of anything\"."]],[899,["Shri Sita's bravery and fortitude"]],[905,["were the special qualities seen in Her life."]],[909,["Every lady must imbibe these qualities."]],[912,["Even if you are separated from your husband"]],[915,["and you are not longer together,"]],[917,["even then, because of your husband,"]],[921,["you should not let that create a loss for you or your children."]],[925,["Because your duty is the most important thing."]],[930,["You should not give up this most important thing."]],[933,["All Sahaja Yoginis should try to get this power of Shakti."]],[941,["Shri Rama's life was also very pure and spotless (nirmal)"]],[945,["and He gave up everything for His wife."]],[949,["When his wife was exiled to the forest,"]],[955,["and He had to live alone,"]],[957,["and when He sacrificed Her,"]],[961,["He gave up all the comforts of the royal life."]],[965,["You know He used to sleep on the grass, on the floor"]],[970,["walked barefeet and wore clothes like an ascetic."]],[977,["All these are not stories This is the truth,"]],[980,["In our world, in India, many people were born"]],[984,["whose life had a high standard of morals"]],[988,["and they never thought about small or low level things."]],[992,["But all these ideal people of our country"]],[995,["have become superfluous over time."]],[1001,["We think that Shri Rama is ours, we are His devotees"]],[1005,["and we can attain Him by only singing bhajans to Him."]],[1008,["We have developed a kind of hypocrisy."]],[1011,["In other countries where they do not have such models (like Shri Rama)"]],[1015,["the people there try to correct themselves."]],[1018,["They try to make themselves ok."]],[1020,["Because you have a model like Shri Ram"]],[1023,["you say you can never become like Him,"]],[1025,["or like Shri Krishna."]],[1028,["We feel they became models,"]],[1029,["but we are not able to relate with Them."]],[1032,["We get feelings like that."]],[1034,["But if we have Shri Rama inside,"]],[1037,["His light can certainly come in our attention."]],[1041,["Why cannot it come? Why should we not attain this?"]],[1044,["Why should we not try to learn about the circumstances"]],[1048,["around which Shri Rama came on this earth?"]],[1051,["A Sahaja Yogi must consider this -"]],[1053,["if we can attain Shri Rama's spiritual state,"]],[1056,["then all our political problems will be resolved,"]],[1059,["all our problems will be over."]],[1063,["This will happen the day Sahay Yogis resolve in their heart"]],[1066,["that they would like to become like Shri Rama."]],[1068,["In our country, where Shri Ram ruled,"]],[1072,["He conducted His rule in a selfless state"]],[1078,["and in a state of enlightment."]],[1084,["And He desired all good qualities should come in His people."]],[1087,["And He wanted that firstly His people to become dharmic,"]],[1090,["get educated and evolved."]],[1093,["He wanted many high ideals should be established in them."]],[1099,["This He tried to do all the time."]],[1103,["And for this He made His life very idealistic (for others to follow)."]],[1106,["Just think, if someone tells you something"]],[1111,["but he himself does not follow his own advise"]],[1113,["then how can you have faith in such a person?"]],[1116,["Therefore you cannot get the qualities."]],[1118,["However, many people say, \"We follow this person or that person\"."]],[1122,["But in reality, they are just the opposite of whom they follow."]],[1125,["Followers of Ram seems to be the most corrupt politicians possible?"]],[1129,["or they have more than ten wives."]],[1131,["How can they say they follow Shri Rama?"]],[1134,["What is the duty of a Sahaja Yogi in his life?"]],[1140,["We also have to bring the light of the Gods in our attention."]],[1145,["For every situation we must think: \"What would Shri Rama have done?\""]],[1151,["If such a question arose then what woud Shri Rama have replied."]],[1156,["If such a question arose then what woud Shri Sita have replied."]],[1159,["What would Sita ji say?"]],[1162,["How would Shri Sita behave?"]],[1164,["If any lady thinks like that"]],[1166,["she would certainly become the Gruhlaxmi of her house."]],[1169,["As you Sahaja Yogis know, Sitaji took many births after that."]],[1174,["And She came as incarnation of Gruhlaxmi as Fatima-bi."]],[1180,["She used to stay at home under a veil,"]],[1183,["but all dharma was done by Her power."]],[1187,["Not necessary for you to go out and give big lectures"]],[1192,["or become a leader. There is no need."]],[1194,["You can do this work from home,"]],[1198,["you can spread Sahaja Yoga to your children, relatives and friends."]],[1206,["But at first you should attain this (Sahaja Yoga)."]],[1209,["After all this work is done, you can spread it to society."]],[1213,["After that you can go elsewhere to spread it, if you want."]],[1216,["But first ladies should have pure character like Sitaji."]],[1223,["First reflection of this purity is a strong maternal feeling of love."]],[1228,["When She was exiled in the jungle along with Her husband"]],[1231,["She never complained that, \"My husband doesn't earn, He doesn't earn."]],[1235,["Just like the women here complain,"]],[1237,["\"He doesn't do this, he doesn't buy this or that\"."]],[1240,["If he is in jungle, then so am I."]],[1242,["Whatever he will eat, I will also eat."]],[1245,["Will I eat before he eats?"]],[1247,["Shri Sita would not have done that."]],[1249,["Let me serve him first and then the brother in law, let them finish"]],[1253,["then I will eat."]],[1254,["Nowadays women think there is too much..."]],[1260,["there is too much pressure of the work on them."]],[1267,["But it is not so."]],[1268,["A woman is like earth element."]],[1272,["She has so much power that she can absorb a lot of pressure."]],[1275,["So much is being given by the earth: flowers, fruit, leaves etc."]],[1280,["In the same manner, women are like the earth element."]],[1284,["We have got so many powers that we can absorb everything inside."]],[1290,["and shower the rain of love which is inside us."]],[1294,["God has given us this power."]],[1296,["So if you have this power -"]],[1298,["for example if this fan is moving, it is due to the electricity."]],[1302,["Then which one is greater, the electricity or the fan?"]],[1308,["If you think the fan is greater because it is moving"]],[1312,["then you are under an illusion."]],[1314,["The manifestation of feminine energy is huge, like an ocean."]],[1319,["With that support men do their work."]],[1324,["This is like potential and kinetic states of energy."]],[1327,["So women are the potential energy and men are the kinetic energy."]],[1331,["But wanting to emulate men, because they can run faster."]],[1335,["women also start running."]],[1336,["There is no need for a woman to do that. She needs to sit."]],[1340,["Roles of both are different"]],[1343,["so each of them need to play their role in solving a problem."]],[1346,["Actually, women can thrive in both activities (potential and kinetic)."]],[1350,["When the time comes women can be more productive than men."]],[1354,["As you may be aware, in Maharashtra there was a widow named Tarabai"]],[1357,["who was 17 years, 17 years only."]],[1360,["She was the younger daughter-in-law of Shivaji"]],[1365,["All lost against Aurangzeb and she defeated him at only 17 years."]],[1369,["and built his grave in a place called Aurangabad."]],[1372,["You can understand today"]],[1374,["that if a woman is able to concentrate all her powers."]],[1379,["Like it is said that when her powers are in a manifested state,"]],[1384,["then she can become fierce (prachand)."]],[1386,["But if she wastes or fritters away her powers"]],[1393,["by wasting it in fighting, arguing, complaining or in frivolous things,"]],[1398,["then her power is completely destroyed."]],[1401,["Women are so powerful"]],[1405,["that if they want, they can work more than men."]],[1410,["However, first of all, they must respect their powers."]],[1413,["By throwing her powers here and there, by destroying her powers,"]],[1417,["she becomes powerless."]],[1420,["These powerless women are of no use to anyone."]],[1422,["Therefore, the woman's role"]],[1425,["is of utmost importance and full of dignity."]],[1428,["Women should therefore be very modest and very wise."]],[1434,["For example, sometimes men use swear words but real women do not."]],[1439,["You might have seen that men argue and can even have physical fights."]],[1443,["Let them! But women do not do that."]],[1446,["Their job is to emit peace,"]],[1448,["their job is to give protection"]],[1451,["and their job is to save everyone."]],[1454,["For example, there is a shield."]],[1457,["A shield cannot function as a sword"]],[1459,["and a sword cannot function as a shield."]],[1461,["So is the shield more important or the sword?"]],[1465,["Obviously the shield, as it can withstand the attack of the sword."]],[1468,["Sometimes the sword may even break but not the shield."]],[1471,["So women must be engulfed in their power."]],[1475,["And the main lever for manifesting this strength"]],[1478,["is the power of humility."]],[1481,["With humility we should establish these powers within us."]],[1485,["This work is not difficult for Sahaja Yogis."]],[1488,["For Sahaja Yogis this is not difficult at all."]],[1490,["I see many Sahaja Yoginis talking so much nonsense."]],[1494,["I don't know why, but anywhere they want to chat non-stop with men."]],[1498,["Once a gentleman came running to Me and said, \"Mother save me, save me!\""]],[1500,["I asked ”What happened?”, He said \"She is after me\"."]],[1502,["I asked, ”Who?”, \"The one who talks a lot.\""]],[1504,["I said, ”The one who talks a lot?”."]],[1506,["He said, \"Yes, save me, I am fed up with her\"."]],[1508,["So he came to hide in My room."]],[1510,["There is no need to excessively talk with men."]],[1513,["What is the need to talk nonsense?"]],[1515,["Amongst women also, no need to talk about unimportant things."]],[1519,["In Sahaja Yoga, I have seen that men make more effort to study."]],[1523,["Women should also do that,"]],[1524,["what is Sahaja Yoga and what chakras there are,"]],[1527,["which chakra have what impact,"]],[1529,["which chakra causes which problem."]],[1533,["They should have full knowledge of this."]],[1535,["If only men learn this knowledge, then women will be left behind."]],[1538,["Women must learn all this."]],[1540,["Now for men, Shri Rama is their role model."]],[1547,["I feel in a way, Muslims have played a good role for us."]],[1553,["I do not criticize them. This problem is not in their country."]],[1556,["Say if you go to Riyad,"]],[1558,["no Muslim will stare at you."]],[1561,["I have not seem anyone doing that."]],[1563,["If there is a lady, they will give her respect."]],[1565,["If any lady is crossing the street,"]],[1567,["they will stop the car out of respect."]],[1569,["There is so much respect for women there."]],[1571,["But here in India, I do not understand why,"]],[1574,["the impact of the muslim culture has been the opposite."]],[1577,["that we see women as an object to be exploited."]],[1581,["They want to see every woman in their path,"]],[1583,["twisting the neck but continue staring."]],[1586,["It is a big sin to stare at every woman."]],[1591,["In Sahaja Yoga, it is considered as an prohibited act."]],[1593,["Absolutely prohibited."]],[1595,["Firstly you will spoil your eyes."]],[1597,["And being in Sahaja Yoga it will cause even more damage."]],[1600,["If more damage does not happen, then you may even become blind."]],[1605,["Sometimes I see people have wandering eyes."]],[1609,["They are talking to someone but eyes are wandering elsewhere."]],[1612,["Nowadays, even women too are learning this."]],[1614,["The biggest loss by doing this is your attention."]],[1619,["If your attention goes here and there,"]],[1622,["if your attention goes here and there,"]],[1624,["then what's the use of Self-Realization?"]],[1626,["Because without focussing attention"]],[1630,["it can't become active."]],[1633,["Focussed attention can only become active."]],[1635,["A focussed attention must be attained."]],[1638,["In the west, this disease is more among men."]],[1640,["It's there in women also but not as much as in the men."]],[1643,["So the western yogis asked me the cure for this disease."]],[1645,["They are not like Indians, they do not think this is good thing."]],[1648,["They consider it a negative thing."]],[1650,["Since they came to Sahaj Yoga, they are asking Me to remove it."]],[1653,["I told them to look only at the ground"]],[1657,["and up to 3 feet on top."]],[1660,["You have no need to see above that."]],[1662,["Look at the ground while walking."]],[1664,["So you will recognise Sahaja Yogis anywhere in the world."]],[1668,["They are the ones walking with their eyes lowered."]],[1670,["You see all good things below 3 feet, such as flowers and children."]],[1676,["Nothing good to see above."]],[1681,["So, that's how you should control your attention."]],[1684,["Now Shri Rama did not need to do this."]],[1686,["However, if you have respect towards Shri Rama,"]],[1690,["you must control your attention like Him."]],[1695,["Explain to your wife,"]],[1700,["that she is a shakti and you respect that quality."]],[1703,["But she must also prove herself worthy of this respect."]],[1706,["Like the shloka: \"Yatra nāryastu pūjyanté ramanté tatra devatāḥ\" -"]],[1710,["\"Where women are worshipped, in such places do Gods reside.\""]],[1715,["But those women must also be worth respecting."]],[1722,["[to audience] What is it? Please sit down."]],[1725,["Ok, sit down. One should not move around during the Puja."]],[1730,["So if the woman is to be worshipped,"]],[1733,["she needs to be worthy of worship."]],[1736,["Who would worship a dirty woman?"]],[1738,["Who would worship a cruel woman?"]],[1741,["Or someone with a demonic temperament? Will anyone worship?"]],[1744,["Only those who are worth of worship"]],[1747,["should be worshipped"]],[1749,["and only in that place God would reside as well."]],[1751,["Firstly, men should realise"]],[1753,["that this lady is the mother of their children."]],[1757,["If husband scolds or mocks his wife in front of children,"]],[1761,["gives her no respect,"]],[1763,["then children will never respect their mother."]],[1766,["Think of it as a relationship"]],[1768,["between a prime minister and a deputy prime minister."]],[1770,["Women should not insult their husbands as well."]],[1773,["Like the delegation of authority from prime minister (father)"]],[1777,["to deputy (mother),"]],[1778,["it can be wrongly delegated to children by the father."]],[1781,["But if the couple are such that they do not have this subtlety,"]],[1786,["then the lady feels she should dominate, the man feels he should."]],[1789,["If woman understand how to handle her man,"]],[1792,["then there would not be any fights."]],[1794,["You should understand that it's very easy to manage men,"]],[1798,["because they are like children."]],[1800,["Its very easy to manage them."]],[1803,["Their temperament is simple, like that of children."]],[1806,["With arguments or by talking a lot, you can't handle them."]],[1809,["You must also forgive them like you forgive children."]],[1813,["They go outside, have fights or arguments and return home stressed."]],[1816,["And then carry this frustration home to the wife."]],[1818,["If they express it outside they will get beaten."]],[1820,["So the wife can sometimes ignore these outbursts."]],[1823,["Until the wife has this attitude towards her husband,"]],[1828,["there cannot be mutual understanding, love and joy between them."]],[1832,["However, the husband should also think about what wife needs"]],[1836,["and what does not."]],[1839,["But this does not mean because she is the wife,"]],[1841,["she can say something wrong or give wrong advise."]],[1844,["In this situation, he must tell her:"]],[1845,["\"This is wrong, I won't do this\"."]],[1847,["\"This is a lie. I won't do that.\""]],[1850,["But no need to fight on small-small matters."]],[1854,["And fighting on trivial issues,"]],[1857,["does not behove a Sahaja Yogi."]],[1859,["I am surprised when Sahaja couples keep on fighting."]],[1864,["They come to complain about each other."]],[1866,["If one Sahaja couple cannot stay peacefully with each other,"]],[1870,["then how can we talk about bringing love to the entire world?"]],[1876,["It will not work out, if you keep fighting like this."]],[1879,["So first thing is, the husband must be fully in a way"]],[1884,["alert to the needs of his wife,"]],[1887,["and know that all the other women in the world,"]],[1891,["are like his sisters and mother."]],[1896,["If this does not manifest even after Sahaja Yoga"]],[1898,["then it cannot happen anywhere else."]],[1901,["There was a gentleman,"]],[1904,["that too a Swiss person and not an Indian."]],[1907,["He was a father of a Sahaja Yogini."]],[1911,["Girl's husband had wandering eyes,"]],[1916,["although he had come to Sahaja Yoga."]],[1918,["They both came to Sahaja Yoga."]],[1920,["The girl was a very good, chaste girl."]],[1923,["He continued with this behavior wherever he went."]],[1926,["So her father, who was not a Sahaja Yogi,"]],[1929,["told his daughter that it was better to leave him,"]],[1932,["saying that, \"If someone cannot be cleansed even with Sahaja yoga,"]],[1935,["then he can never be cleansed. You leave him\"."]],[1938,["She said \"He has improved slightly.\""]],[1940,["Father replied: \"If he cannot be fully clean,"]],[1943,["he is not a Sahaja Yogi. Leave him and have no relations with him\"."]],[1947,["Even someone who is not a Sahaja Yogi can understand"]],[1951,["that if a person's eyes cannot be stable after Sahaja Yoga,"]],[1955,["if his attention does not become stable,"]],[1959,["then there is something wrong."]],[1962,["Another key feature of our Indian culture"]],[1965,["is that men's and women's circle of social interactions"]],[1967,["should be restricted to brother and sister relationship."]],[1970,["But this does not happen."]],[1971,["I see immeadiately frivolous women"]],[1974,["just falling over to talk to men."]],[1976,["They will chatter on with the men."]],[1979,["I do not understand the need."]],[1983,["They will not sit together with other women but with men."]],[1985,["Same with some men who are engrossed by women."]],[1988,["They see some lady and start pursuing her -"]],[1991,["any woman, even if she is a house maid or anyone else."]],[1995,["Anyone they can reach, they will pursue."]],[1997,["They have no self respect."]],[2001,["They think this is manhood."]],[2003,["but the pinnacle of manhood is Shri Rama."]],[2006,["He is sitting up there, who is the epitome of manhood"]],[2010,["But the people who are at the lowest level,"]],[2013,["they think they represent perfect manhood."]],[2015,["How can this be manhood?"]],[2016,["They should either not worship Shri Rama"]],[2018,["and follow the devil instead,"]],[2020,["or if they actually believe in Shri Rama, they should follow His ideals."]],[2023,["And that is why nowadays, children and women are getting spoiled."]],[2029,["Even then, it's a unique feature of Indian culture"]],[2032,["that women have managed well."]],[2034,["If they were like Americans women,"]],[2036,["then all of you would have been finished."]],[2039,["In America, they have caused trouble"]],[2043,["and the men are in a pitiable state."]],[2045,["I tell you there if a man gets married 2-3 times,"]],[2049,["he is bankrupted"]],[2052,["and if a lady marries 2-3 times,"]],[2054,["she will have the means to build a palace."]],[2058,["So what's good there?"]],[2059,["Children run away from home. What is their social structure?"]],[2062,["So this is a speciality of our Indian women,"]],[2064,["because they have grown up in Indian traditions,"]],[2067,["they manage the house and children well, know their responsibility."]],[2071,["But this is changing."]],[2073,["They say, \"If my husband does like this, so why cannot I\"?"]],[2077,["They ask, \"If he does this to me, why shouldn't I?\"."]],[2079,["If he runs after 10 women, then we go with 15 men."]],[2082,["They say, \"If he is doing bad things and going to hell,"]],[2087,["then I will go before him\"."]],[2088,["Women should not talk like this."]],[2090,["The foundation of dharma is in women's hands."]],[2093,["Women must manage this."]],[2095,["They must bring their husband on the path of dharma"]],[2098,["by explaining and by cajoling him to keep him close."]],[2101,["This is her biggest duty and she has this power in her."]],[2104,["However, if she herself is not dharmic..."]],[2107,["In dharma, the biggest dharma is forgiveness."]],[2109,["If she does not know how to forgive,"]],[2111,["then even if she follows any religion, it will be of no use."]],[2114,["First thing she must have forgiveness."]],[2117,["She should forgive her children, her husband,"]],[2120,["give refuge to people working in the house and everyone else."]],[2123,["This is her duty."]],[2124,["Some challenges come like this."]],[2127,["Now see, this work that I am doing,"]],[2129,["even Shri Rama could not have done it, nor Shri Krishna,"]],[2132,["nor Lord Jesus."]],[2135,["Had it been Shri Rama, he would cut everyone's head off."]],[2140,["He would have killed everyone saying, \"Now you go."]],[2142,["You are useless, adharmic,"]],[2144,["you run after women, you are licentious, hence you go\"."]],[2148,["Do not know how many he would be finished right away?"]],[2151,["Second, if Shri Krishna came, He would have used his sudarshan chakra."]],[2155,["That too would have spoilt the situation."]],[2157,["Had Lord Christ came, He would have allowed Himself to be crucified."]],[2160,["This is very good - go for crucifixion once, work is done."]],[2163,["Better than being crucified everyday."]],[2166,["Only a Mother can do this work."]],[2169,["Only a Mother can do it, because of Her power of love is so strong,"]],[2172,["that anything can be worked out by relying on Her power of love."]],[2177,["She takes up everything"]],[2179,["and her ways are so endearing"]],[2181,["that children do not react negatively on being corrected by her."]],[2184,["Suppose something happens, something goes wrong,"]],[2186,["it's the mother who knows how to handle it."]],[2189,["She may scold the children later."]],[2191,["As they know that mother loves them, scolds them for their benefit"]],[2195,["and hence they do not grudge it."]],[2197,["With father scolding, children may react but not with mother's."]],[2200,["Because her love is without any self-interest."]],[2204,["She does not want anything for herself."]],[2206,["She wants that her children should be good, get all her powers,"]],[2210,["gain everything good that exists inside her."]],[2213,["If a mother has these feelings"]],[2217,["then her children will turn out fine."]],[2219,["But many mothers are very forward, abrasive,"]],[2222,["get involved in everything, will speak on everything."]],[2226,["The poor husband will keep sitting quietly."]],[2228,["while she will be standing in the front."]],[2230,["When this happens, then children will become spoiled."]],[2233,["Growing under such a adverse environment,"]],[2236,["children can grow up to be destructive,"]],[2239,["which can be very harmful."]],[2241,["The lady, being the potential energy, should be behind"]],[2244,["and keep her husband in front."]],[2246,["Its ok. Whatever the husband does,"]],[2249,["the wife must help him from behind."]],[2251,["The source of his power is wife - this you must understand."]],[2256,["Therefore how pure and hard-working the lady needs to be."]],[2260,["You will say that Mother is leaving all the onus on the women."]],[2263,["I do this because I know you are very powerful,"]],[2265,["I know we women have many powers."]],[2267,["Because I am Myself a Mother."]],[2269,["Now see, it's been left to Me to redeem thousands,"]],[2272,["to cure so many diseases."]],[2274,["From morning to evening, I am curing sick people."]],[2276,["After that, give them Realisation. Did anyone work like this?"]],[2279,["Only Ahilya was saved (by Lord Rama) and that was it."]],[2282,["Lord Christ cured in total only about 21 people."]],[2286,["I must have cured 21,000 people by now."]],[2289,["I roam around the planet, doing this or that work for everyone."]],[2294,["It's still going on, but I do not feel it's work,"]],[2296,["because it's the power of love. This power of love runs ahead of Me."]],[2300,["Now, before going outside I think of taking a bandhan,"]],[2304,["as I don't know what kind of people touch My feet."]],[2306,["But I forget doing this."]],[2308,["As soon as a troubled person comes in front of Me,"]],[2310,["I absorb all their problems."]],[2312,["The love is like that - it acts on its own."]],[2316,["I know that it is this love acting and doing all the work."]],[2320,["I do not feel bad about this. Whatever is happening is ok."]],[2322,["There will be some discomfort, let it happen."]],[2325,["All this only a Mother can do."]],[2327,["Therefore, I have my special attention on you,"]],[2330,["that you do work in a peaceful and steady manner."]],[2335,["Also men need to now fully support their women,"]],[2341,["fully understand and respect them."]],[2344,["Until the two wheels of a chariot are of the same size,"]],[2350,["it goes around in circles."]],[2352,["It does not go forward."]],[2354,["They both should be the similar,"]],[2358,["but one is for the left and the other for the right."]],[2361,["The left wheel will not fit on the right side, nor the opposite way."]],[2365,["That is why there are two types of wheel."]],[2368,["These both types of wheel are working well"]],[2371,["because they are alike in some sense"]],[2375,["and not alike in another sense."]],[2379,["Compared to each other"]],[2383,["they are similar in sense of height, length and width"]],[2389,["but they work differently."]],[2394,["Similarly, this happens in our life."]],[2399,["So Shri Ramachandra ji"]],[2401,["did not think only about the husband and wife."]],[2411,["He did not also only think about His children and the dynasty."]],[2417,["He thought about everyone, his brother, sister, mother, father etc.,"]],[2422,["just like a normal human being should."]],[2426,["After that, He thought about society as well."]],[2432,["He thought about the general public,"]],[2434,["about the country,"]],[2436,["and kingdom."]],[2438,["Across His life, in all normal and typical human activities,"]],[2443,["He showed how a human should ideally behave."]],[2450,["The man who loved His wife so much,"]],[2453,["left Her despite knowing that She was completely pure."]],[2460,["Nowadays, they make properties for the wife"]],[2462,["or the wife needs this or that thing or wants to built something."]],[2467,["And if it's said, give 2 paisa to the poor then will not."]],[2472,["Otherwise they give to their childen, nephews etc."]],[2475,["It is a disease among the ruling class."]],[2478,["And Shri Rama, He renounced even such a wife"]],[2482,["who was the incarnation of the Devi and extremely pure."]],[2487,["Then we must re-think about our attachments,"]],[2491,["about our relationships or properties."]],[2494,["And some people are just..."]],[2496,["Previously in the West, husband-wife relation was not good."]],[2499,["After Sahaja Yoga relation is good, but the wife became everything."]],[2503,["In our collective, at least 4-5 leaders had to leave Sahaja Yoga,"]],[2506,["because of their wives."]],[2509,["Because the wife was not good, though the husband was good."]],[2511,["Their wife brainwashed them, leading to their ruin."]],[2516,["At least five yogis went out because of their wives."]],[2521,["So even here I would say, that the wives should understand"]],[2526,["what Sahaja Yoga is"]],[2528,["and what is their place in it."]],[2532,["And the husband too, in such situations,"]],[2534,["should not agree to his wife at all."]],[2537,["Should tell her that, “You talk and run about too much. Be quiet!"]],[2543,["You are of no use. Your chakras are not alright\"."]],[2547,["When the husband responds to her like that,"]],[2550,["only then will she become alright."]],[2552,["Instead you accept to spoil your chakras, if she spoils hers."]],[2555,["If she says, \"Do this\", then you do that."]],[2558,["If she tells you to steal money, then you do it."]],[2561,["Even after coming to Sahaja Yoga,"]],[2563,["your subtle catches still stick on."]],[2567,["In this you must give full attention."]],[2570,["On the occasion of Shri Rama today,"]],[2571,["we must reflect on Shri Hanuman,"]],[2574,["how He was so devoted to Shri Rama"]],[2581,["and how He was busy at His service and disposal."]],[2585,["And being all the time at Shri Rama's service,"]],[2590,["He knew that His entire life would have significance."]],[2597,["We should also adopt Shri Hanuman's wisdom in Sahaja Yoga."]],[2604,["This does not mean"]],[2606,["that you keep on cooking and sending food for Me. Absolutely not."]],[2610,["Because I hardly eat anything"]],[2611,["and by cooking too much, you put Me in a difficult situation."]],[2615,["One person sends some dish, another something else."]],[2618,["Like it is said that food should be offered to God first,"]],[2620,["but for a God who does not eat, why trouble Her with food?"]],[2624,["Food is not needed. Nothing is needed."]],[2626,["What is required is a commitment to serve without any delay."]],[2630,["Did Shri Hanuman ever cook and send food to Shri Rama?"]],[2633,["Delhi people have bothered Me so much cooking for Me all the time,"]],[2637,["that I have stipulated"]],[2638,["that if they cook anymore, I would not come to Delhi."]],[2643,["Do what is required."]],[2646,["It is useless to force food on someone who does not eat."]],[2651,["Or for someone without any needs, getting bangles or something else."]],[2654,["Your Mother does not need anything."]],[2656,["My house is full. I am troubled by all this."]],[2659,["I say that get only flowers and nothing else."]],[2662,["I need nothing. Flowers are enough."]],[2664,["And decoration with flowers should not be of thousands rupees."]],[2666,["Today you have decorated flowers modestly, not too much."]],[2669,["Sometimes I'm worried with how many flowers you put on the stage."]],[2674,["So do things in balance, so that your Mother will appreciate it."]],[2677,["Your Mother is simple. She has no appreciation for these things."]],[2683,["So I want to emphasise, that you need to learn from Shri Hanuman,"]],[2688,["to find contentment in serving."]],[2690,["So what service is specifically needed?"]],[2692,["I need no special service."]],[2695,["I am healthy and need not much service."]],[2699,["However, if you want to serve Me, then do service to Sahaja Yoga."]],[2704,["Whoever will be serving in Sahaja Yoga, will be serving Me."]],[2707,["How many people have you given Realisation?"]],[2710,["How many women have you given Realisation to?"]],[2712,["How many did you transform? How many did you take interest in?"]],[2716,["Whenever someone new comes to the program"]],[2718,["yogis say, \"You have this or that possession\", they get after him."]],[2721,["So he runs away."]],[2722,["I asked a gentleman, \"You got your Realisation. Why did you leave?\""]],[2726,["He said that after the program,"]],[2728,["yogis told him he had three possessions inside."]],[2732,["He was even told the number of bhoots."]],[2738,["I asked him why did he believe the yogi?"]],[2740,["He said that he seemed like an authority"]],[2742,["and came running to tell him that he had three possessions."]],[2746,["I do not know who said that to him, but the newcomer ran away."]],[2749,["So in Sahaja Yoga,"]],[2752,["what we need to learn from Shri Hanuman is His eagerness."]],[2755,["\"Ram kaj karne ko tatpar\" (eager to do Shri Rama's work)."]],[2759,["What is our kaj (work)?"]],[2761,["\"My work is Sahaja Yoga."]],[2764,["My work is Sahaja Yoga,"]],[2766,["to raise the Kundalini, to give Realisation to people,"]],[2770,["to get peace and love in them,"]],[2773,["to talk about love."]],[2779,["explaining about all chakras etc. in Sahaja Yoga,"]],[2784,["whatever they need - to explain that\"."]],[2786,["Now when I said this, people started giving long lectures."]],[2790,["Some people started giving so many lectures"]],[2793,["that I had to tell them to stop"]],[2797,["otherwise the other yogis will be finished."]],[2799,["People complained that they lecture for 2 hours."]],[2802,["There is no time to hear Your talk and do Aarti."]],[2805,["We have to go home just with this."]],[2807,["So I had that person's lecture stopped."]],[2809,["He said that when I go then he doesn't know what happens to him."]],[2812,["He told Me, \"I feel like giving a lecture. How can I correct this?\"."]],[2816,["I told him, \"You put supari (betel nut) in your mouth.\""]],[2820,["\"How large the nut should be?\" - he asked Me."]],[2825,["I said, \"It depends on the size of your mouth."]],[2829,["If you do not even know how big should be the betel nut,"]],[2832,["then what do you talk about Sahaja Yoga?"]],[2834,["You do not have this wisdom either\"."]],[2838,["People like talking a lot in Sahaja Yoga."]],[2841,["They think they have got a platform to give lectures."]],[2843,["They have got the mike and want to speak. Cannot leave the mike."]],[2847,["Once they got hold of the mic they cannot leave it."]],[2850,["This is a new disease."]],[2853,["So you must understand, \"Why to give a lecture?"]],[2857,["There are so many of Mother's lectures, listen to those only\"."]],[2860,["So whenever you have a function,"]],[2863,["display a video of Mine"]],[2867,["or play My tapes."]],[2869,["Give pencil and paper to people, after, to write their questions."]],[2874,["Then you give them Realisation"]],[2878,["and ask them to write any of their problems and bring it next time,"]],[2882,["any problem in the beginning like someone is sick or in trouble."]],[2886,["Now there are also people like this -"]],[2888,["there is one person, he would even come to Calcutta to cure someone."]],[2893,["Now he will go..."]],[2895,["Now people are inviting him to come to Russia to cure people."]],[2900,["One person only is running from here to there like Shri Hanuman."]],[2905,["All of you can cure."]],[2907,["All of you can cure everyone."]],[2909,["All women can do it, all men can do it as well,"]],[2912,["but no one tries."]],[2914,["By giving lectures how many have been cured?"]],[2918,["I don't know why there is only one person in India"]],[2922,["who can cure people,"]],[2924,["while in London there are 15-20 people who can cure"]],[2929,["and there are in France as well."]],[2931,["One should learn the technique to clear people."]],[2935,["Take a bandhan and do it."]],[2938,["For this, will you call people from outside?"]],[2941,["For what purpose are you a Sahaja Yogi?"]],[2943,["You roam around wearing a badge of Sahaja Yoga but cannot even cure."]],[2946,["Then, remove the badge."]],[2948,["You cannot even clear yourself or cure your diseases,"]],[2952,["so how will you cure others?"]],[2953,["I must tell you that everybody has got all the power to cure anyone."]],[2959,["You must learn this. You must master it."]],[2962,["Instead of inviting someone to Calcutta,"]],[2965,["people from Calcutta should go out to cure."]],[2968,["It's a matter of a little courage. Nohting will happen to you."]],[2971,["Neither can you get sick or anything else can happen."]],[2974,["The more you work in Sahaja Yoga, the deeper you will become."]],[2977,["Because the wider the tree is, the deeper its roots are."]],[2984,["Between Sahaja Yoga and work of other incarnations,"]],[2989,["there is one major difference."]],[2992,["The other incarnations had never worked in society before."]],[2997,["Nobody had got these powers."]],[3000,["It was not for the masses."]],[3002,["Only one or two people had attained this power."]],[3004,["Like King Janaka who gave Realisation to Nachiketa."]],[3008,["But now you all have got this power."]],[3010,["Now just grow in such a manner that you do not need anything else."]],[3017,["You can cure yourself, you can cure others."]],[3020,["You can understand Sahaja Yoga. You have everything you need."]],[3024,["But even now your attention is wandering."]],[3027,["I do not understand, what are you running after?"]],[3029,["You have still not grasped this."]],[3032,["In Sahaja Yoga, for everyone there is nothing but blessings."]],[3036,["You will not have any shortage of anything."]],[3040,["That is if you contribute to something in Sahaja Yoga."]],[3043,["Even if you do not work, you will get blessings."]],[3046,["Whoever I see, his business increased or career progressed,"]],[3049,["this or that worked out for him."]],[3052,["Everyone is continously receiving something or the other."]],[3056,["There was no sacrifice needed."]],[3059,["On the other hand, let me tell you"]],[3061,["when the freedom struggle in India happened,"]],[3064,["even we were troubled so much."]],[3068,["made to lie down on ice, given electric shocks."]],[3071,["My father and mother went to jail so many times. Our house was sold."]],[3075,["We started living in a hut... our cars were also sold."]],[3078,["We sacrified so much. You do not have to do anything like that."]],[3083,["But it should not be only receiving all the time."]],[3086,["You need to give as well."]],[3088,["If one door is open,"]],[3091,["you should open another one as well."]],[3093,["Keeping only one door open does not make the air flow."]],[3096,["Everyone tells Me that \"I received this blessing or that blessing\"."]],[3098,["What benevolence have you done to others?"]],[3103,["We must pay attention to this aspect:"]],[3105,["\"What benevolent action did we do?\"."]],[3110,["But there are many fights for leadership."]],[3114,["Who will be the leader? Many big fights."]],[3116,["There is a readymade platform so people want to lead."]],[3119,["You should know that all this is Mother's play."]],[3123,["You will not know the day that you fall from there."]],[3127,["Specially women should not get involved in leadership politics."]],[3130,["They will fall from the top to the bottom immediately."]],[3133,["And men should also understand, that there is no leader as such."]],[3138,["This is a game made by Mother and do not get entangled in this."]],[3142,["So I said that, \"Let the leaders come forward\". Leaders of what?"]],[3146,["All this is a game made by the Mother."]],[3148,["There are no leaders."]],[3150,["This is just a test of your wisdom."]],[3154,["If you ego rises due to leadership, then you are gone."]],[3159,["It will be revealed immediately."]],[3160,["In Sahaja Yoga nothing is hidden. Everything is exposed."]],[3166,["Even if I say something or not,"]],[3169,["they will expose their faces by themselves, on their own."]],[3172,["He says, \"I am the leader\" - and tomorrow he will shame himself. Why?"]],[3176,["They say that they did this bad thing."]],[3179,["So the leader has greater responsibility"]],[3182,["to be better, sweet, humble and loving than others"]],[3188,["and taking everyone along, consulting them and moving forward."]],[3192,["Now on the auspicious occasion of Shri Rama special day today,"]],[3197,["we should pray for all qualities demonstrated in His life."]],[3202,["If you can do only even a fraction of what He did,"]],[3204,["your Mother's life would be most worthwhile."]],[3208,["He was in exile in the jungle for so many days."]],[3211,["He wandered in jungles barefeet, did so much hard work."]],[3218,["And He did this just to obey the order of His father."]],[3222,["Now to obey Me, you need not to go into the forest for exile."]],[3227,["Nor to be barefeet or go hungry. Nothing at all."]],[3230,["Everything is ok."]],[3232,["But in Sahaja Yoga, you must know how to cure people"]],[3236,["and their diseases."]],[3238,["And you should have complete knowledge about Sahaja Yoga."]],[3242,["and most importantly you should know,"]],[3244,["that Sahaja Yoga is love."]],[3246,["It is the power of love that is working things out and no one else."]],[3250,["Because of that power, everyone can prosper."]],[3254,["This is not for one person"]],[3257,["or for any special people."]],[3261,["This is neither for any one country"]],[3263,["but for the whole world."]],[3268,["We should see also is how our attention is and where does it go."]],[3273,["If again and again it wanders, we should restrain it, stop it."]],[3277,["Fill the power of Spirit in your attention."]],[3281,["And a person should do every task with unwavering attention."]],[3285,["The person who will do this with devotion and love,"]],[3288,["will go very deep."]],[3291,["Or if not, there is anyways a lot of rubbish around."]],[3298,["And you know how garbage is finally disposed off."]],[3304,["So if you want to become garbage"]],[3306,["and you feel that you are very special,"]],[3308,["you are very good and can do this or that..."]],[3311,["First thing is humility,"]],[3314,["not only towards Me but towards everyone."]],[3317,["Talk humbly and with love."]],[3321,["You will see how an ordinary human, who is useless,"]],[3327,["can blossom like a lotus in Sahaja Yoga."]],[3330,["And his fragrance spreads in all four direction."]],[3332,["People come and tell Me immediately,"]],[3334,["\"Mother, he is a wonderful person, he is indeed like this\"."]],[3338,["Like that you should work."]],[3341,["Like people say about Maryada Purushottama that He was wonderful,"]],[3344,["similarly they will say about you."]],[3346,["The biggest thing is that for Me, you are the temple of Shri Rama"]],[3350,["and you have to develop this temple within you."]],[3352,["Let it be worshipped. Take care of it."]],[3355,["Watch it and live with your self-esteem intact."]],[3359,["Take the full benefit"]],[3365,["of your Self-Realization."]],[3368,["Along with that, you must have full respect and devotion towards it."]],[3372,["You should think, \"Now we are realized. How can we do this?\""]],[3376,["\"We are yogis. We cannot do this."]],[3378,["This cannot be done by us as this is wrong.\""]],[3381,["You will see that you will receive blessings immediately,"]],[3386,["immediately, at that time."]],[3388,["People are calling me Rokhra (money) Devi,"]],[3391,["as they decide something and money come in for that."]],[3394,["So many results, so much benefits everyone is getting."]],[3397,["Now based on your blessings, pass them to the world as well."]],[3403,["Like Shri Rama used all His powers for the benevolence of people"]],[3410,["and for the world to see an ideal man,"]],[3414,["the embodiment of an ideal man."]],[3417,["Whenever this occurs inside us, you will be surprised,"]],[3421,["what level you will reach."]],[3425,["You should not have any disease left. All diseases should go away."]],[3429,["Clear off everything. All bad habits should be dropped."]],[3433,["Eat what is needed, talk as much as needed."]],[3437,["Witness everything"]],[3439,["and for this you must look inward."]],[3441,["You should have a perceptive mind and introspect,"]],[3448,["that is looking inside yourself,"]],[3450,["looking inside yourself -"]],[3452,["\"antar nirikshan\" (internal inspection)."]],[3454,["Keep on watching, \"What am I doing? Why am I doing this or that?"]],[3457,["What should I be doing?"]],[3459,["There is no need for this. I am a Sahaja Yogi. Why am I doing this?"]],[3462,["Where is my mind going? Stop it.\""]],[3465,["By doing this all the time, you will get into meditation."]],[3469,["And on its own, your Kundalini will be pleased with this"]],[3473,["and bless you with a lot of contentment,"]],[3476,["that you will say, \"Mother, what a blessing I have received!\""]],[3479,["But only when you jump into it, you know what it is."]],[3483,["Jumping into it is the only small bit of hard work."]],[3488,["Shri Rama was born at midnight,"]],[3492,["so I had said, \"Let's have the Puja at leisure\". So that's how it is."]],[3495,["In Shri Rama's Puja, there is not much work"]],[3498,["as is not very elaborate or long."]],[3501,["But there is certainly something to understand,"]],[3504,["because He was in human form,"]],[3506,["so being in human form,"]],[3508,["He represents the humanity within us"]],[3515,["through which we understand the world,"]],[3517,["through which our intellect, our interest and our thoughts"]],[3524,["get changed."]],[3526,["All these things are Shri Rama."]],[3528,["Only through Him, can our ideas change."]],[3533,["Only through Him, can our nature change"]],[3536,["because He is our ideal."]],[3539,["Only after achieving Him as an ideal,"]],[3542,["you can reach other higher ideals"]],[3544,["as He was the ideal human being."]],[3547,["It is such a big thing,"]],[3548,["that God decided to come to this world in a human form"]],[3551,["to became our ideal."]],[3553,["He went through all hardships and adversity,"]],[3556,["to show us that despite any adversity,"]],[3560,["a person should not abandon his Dharma."]],[3562,["You should not leave the path of Vishwa Dharma"]],[3565,["and maintain your state of yoga."]],[3568,["My unending blessings to you all."]]]);
